.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-reseller-service-terminate - Terminate a service (reseller)


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro reseller service terminate  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Terminate a service (reseller)

.PP
\fB"confirm": true\fR required (422 \fBconfirm_required\fR). \fB"immediate": true\fR cancels now: billing stops and the resource and its data are deleted (status \fBcancelling\fR, \fBcancelled\fR within about a minute; cannot be undone; 403 \fBimmediate_disabled\fR when the operator turned it off). Without \fBimmediate\fR a cancellation request is filed (active services only; a suspended service answers 409 \fBterminate_needs_immediate\fR). Cancellation rules of the product are checked first (422 \fBcancellation_rejected\fR). A cancelled service or an existing request returns \fBchanged: false\fR\&. Only services on the reseller's own account (404 \fBservice_not_found\fR otherwise); reseller keys only (403 \fBnot_reseller\fR, sub-account keys 403 \fBsubkey_forbidden\fR). Built for billing-panel modules (WHMCS / WISECP Gyro reseller module) that mirror the panel's lifecycle on Gyro.

.PP
API: POST /cloud/reseller/services/{id}/terminate (operationId terminateResellerService, scope reseller)


